# Ollama

## Parmeters

Arquitecture: Structure and goal of the model (LLMA means Large Language Model Meta AI)
Parameter: Size and bias used for the model to learn (in B size)
Contex lenght: Amount of Token can process in a single input
Embedding lenght: The amount of embeeding space it have for text interpretation
Quantization: compress model in exchange of logic (in B)

Library model, like codeGemma, is a collection of light model for variaty.\
Visual model, like llava, can view and create visial content.

### Modelfile

make "ModelFile" and star with:
"From <model>

PARAMETER temperature <floatTemp>

SYSTEM """
  You are James a smart assistant that answer succintly

"""
"

Then type the command `ollama create james -f ./ModelFile` to make a model based on modelfile then `ollama run james` to use it

### Rest

Type `curl http>// localhost:11434api/generate -d "{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "prompt":"Why is the sky blue?",
  "stream": false # Necessary for clearer reuslt
}`

to get a REST result.\
ollama api.md have more information about it

